{"id":"n64546-4-9","stage":2,"title":"들여다보다 · 看望","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n64546-4-9-1","ko":"가끔 병원에 찾아가서 동생 좀 들여다보니?","zh":"你会偶尔去医院看望弟弟吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"가끔","meaning":"偶尔，有时，时而，间或","explanation":"가끔：偶尔，有时，时而，间或。","readings":[{"term":"가끔","audio":"/audio/712074afaec5737d4bcb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65204","senseId":"1","lemma":"가끔","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가끔","audio":"/audio/712074afaec5737d4bcb.mp3"}},{"text":"병원에","meaning":"医院","explanation":"병원：医院；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"병원","audio":"/audio/4f4c2d79c47ca512edb7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62271","senseId":"1","lemma":"병원","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"병원에","audio":"/audio/2610e1319b7ca0517a20.mp3"}},{"text":"찾아가서","meaning":"去，去找，去见，拜访","explanation":"찾아가다：去，去找，去见，拜访；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"찾아가다","audio":"/audio/edb19d5b3755c5e82fe0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71812","senseId":"1","lemma":"찾아가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"찾아가서","audio":"/audio/127d1dbdce1c60f20d11.mp3"}},{"text":"동생","meaning":"弟弟；妹妹","explanation":"동생：弟弟；妹妹。","readings":[{"term":"동생","audio":"/audio/bc9b651fd875fefcac75.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70748","senseId":"1","lemma":"동생","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"동생","audio":"/audio/bc9b651fd875fefcac75.mp3"}},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一下","explanation":"좀：一下。","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"3","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}},{"text":"들여다보니?","meaning":"看望，探视","explanation":"들여다보다：看望，探视；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"들여다보다","audio":"/audio/75accac34d15a17868a9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64546","senseId":"4","lemma":"들여다보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"들여다보니","audio":"/audio/17f1522de1f044fdbff8.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"712074afaec5737d","term":"가끔","zh":"偶尔，有时，时而，间或","audio":"/audio/712074afaec5737d4bcb.mp3","entryId":"65204","definition":"不经常，偶然一次。","pronunciation":["가끔"]},{"id":"4f4c2d79c47ca512","term":"병원","zh":"医院","audio":"/audio/4f4c2d79c47ca512edb7.mp3","entryId":"62271","definition":"具备相关设施、由医生和护士治疗病人的地方。","pronunciation":["병ː원"]},{"id":"edb19d5b3755c5e8","term":"찾아가다","zh":"去，去找，去见，拜访","audio":"/audio/edb19d5b3755c5e82fe0.mp3","entryId":"71812","definition":"去见某人或去做某事。","pronunciation":["차자가다"]},{"id":"bc9b651fd875fefc","term":"동생","zh":"弟弟；妹妹","audio":"/audio/bc9b651fd875fefcac75.mp3","entryId":"70748","definition":"用于指称或称呼相同父母所生的兄弟姐妹或亲戚兄弟姐妹中比自己年幼的人。","pronunciation":["동생"]},{"id":"70ae9bc35b2d378b","term":"좀","zh":"一下","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3","entryId":"75798","definition":"主要用于委婉请求或征得同意。","pronunciation":["좀"]},{"id":"75accac34d15a178","term":"들여다보다","zh":"看望，探视","audio":"/audio/75accac34d15a17868a9.mp3","entryId":"64546","definition":"途经某地顺便看。","pronunciation":["드려다보다"]}],"audio":"/audio/d6281731560cb9ab0985.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n64546-4-9-2","ko":"병원이 회사 근처에 있으니 시간 날 때마다 가죠.","zh":"医院就在公司附近，所以每次有空我都会去。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"병원이","meaning":"医院","explanation":"병원：医院；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"병원","audio":"/audio/4f4c2d79c47ca512edb7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62271","senseId":"1","lemma":"병원","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"병원이","audio":"/audio/2c164a1775608e5c63f6.mp3"}},{"text":"회사","meaning":"公司，企业，会社","explanation":"회사：公司，企业，会社。","readings":[{"term":"회사","audio":"/audio/a109dcd7f6f11c2e1703.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31668","senseId":"1","lemma":"회사","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"회사","audio":"/audio/a109dcd7f6f11c2e1703.mp3"}},{"text":"근처에","meaning":"附近，近处","explana